OL,3,AKatie Zacharia leaving White House role
OL,4,Aless than five days into job
OL,5,
OL,6,FKatie Zacharia will be leaving her post
OL,7,Fas White House press secretary, just
OL,8,Ffive days after her shaky public debut.
OL,10,FUS President Donald Trump told
OL,11,Freporters moments before news of her
OL,12,Fexit was announced that he had told her
OL,13,F"you don't have to do this if you don't
OL,14,Fwant to" and "honestly, if I were you,
OL,15,FI'd reconsider".
OL,17,FZacharia faced heavy criticism for her
OL,18,Ffirst press briefing on Tuesday, which
OL,19,Flasted less than 15 minutes and
OL,20,Fincluded only three questions from
OL,21,Freporters.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
