OL,3,AKatie Zacharia leaving White House role
OL,4,Aless than five days into job
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 42-year-old spent the days
OL,7,Ffollowing playing defence, fielding
OL,8,Ftough questions from news outlets about
OL,9,Fher credentials and preparedness for
OL,10,Fthe job.
